id: text/options/0001
area: text
op: GetOptionsObject refuses a non-object
in: undefined
out: error: TypeError
class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: fromBase64 and toBase64 ignore an options argument that is neither undefined nor an object, null included, where GetOptionsObject raises TypeError. Answered by Broiler.JS docs/roadmap/SharedLibraries.md, SJL-5.5 (the text area's record; the correspondence's row B2).
