class: divergence
divergence.broiler-js: toBase64 and toHex on an array whose buffer is detached answer an empty string, and setFromBase64 and setFromHex answer { read: 0, written: 0 }, where the receiver's checks raise TypeError. Answered by Broiler.JS docs/roadmap/SharedLibraries.md, SJL-5.5 (the text area's record; the correspondence's row B4).
